#
# Synthesizes the NYXUS UI sound set from pure math (stdlib only —
# wave + struct, no samples, no dependencies) into
# ~/.local/share/nyxus/sounds/. Rerun any time to regenerate.
#
# The palette: short, soft, synthetic — sci-fi console, not Windows.
# Everything is mixed quiet (peak ~0.30) so it sits UNDER music.
#
#   open.wav       rising dual-sine blip        (window opens)
#   close.wav      falling dual-sine blip       (window closes)
#   workspace.wav  40ms crystal tick            (workspace switch)
#   shot.wav       noise-click + high ping      (screenshot)
#   on.wav         3-note ascending chime       (something enabled)
#   off.wav        2-note descending chime      (something disabled)
#   boot.wav       1.4s pad swell               (splash curtain)
#
